  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to Bonny Dune, a beautifully designed and exceptionally located coastal home in the heart of Seaside, one of Florida’s most beloved beach communities. Just a 5-minute walk from the sugar-white sands of Seaside Beach and Seagrove Beach West, this home offers the perfect blend of classic coastal charm and modern comfort in an unbeatable walkable location. <br>expedia<br><br>This thoughtfully appointed residence features 3 bedrooms and 3+ bathrooms, comfortably accommodating up to nine guests — ideal for family vacations, multi-family getaways, or long-weekend escapes. With nearly 2,000 sq ft of living space spread over multiple levels, the home offers plenty of room to relax, entertain, and create lasting memories by the Gulf. <br><br>Step inside to discover a bright, open floor plan with abundant natural light, a gourmet kitchen equipped for effortless meal prep, and inviting gathering spaces that flow onto private balconies and outdoor living areas. Whether you’re enjoying morning coffee overlooking lush surroundings or hosting al fresco dinners on the patio, outdoor living is beautifully integrated into everyday life here. <br><br>The home’s location on Forest Street places you just steps from Seaside’s charming amenities — from boutique shops, cafés, and galleries to the vibrant Seaside Farmers Market and renowned local restaurants. Experience the best of coastal living without ever needing to get in your car. <br><br>Property Highlights<br>• Prime Seaside location — minutes from beach, town center & attractions <br>• Spacious 3BR / 3+BA home with flexible sleeping arrangements <br>• Multiple outdoor living spaces, balconies & screened porches <br>• Free Wi-Fi, fully equipped kitchen, laundry & parking <br>• Short walking distance to shops, dining, parks & community events <br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS (SLEEPS 9)<br>1ST FLOOR:<br>• Guest Bedroom: 1 Twin over Twin Bunk Bed with Twin Trundle Underneath, Private Guest Bathroom<br>• Guest Bedroom: 1 Queen Bed, Private Guest Bathroom, Private Porch Access<br>• Master Bedroom: 1 Queen Bed, Private Master Bathroom, Private Porch Access<br>• Full-size washer and dryer<br><br>2ND FLOOR:<br>• Living area with 1 Queen Sleeper Sofa - Front and Rear Patio Doors to Private Balconies with amazing views<br>• Gourmet Kitchen with upgraded appliances, center island with breakfast bar seating, and balcony access<br>• Formal Dining seating for eight (plus two at the breakfast bar) with balcony access to the front of the home<br><br>3RD FLOOR:<br>• Loft Area: 1 Day Bed, Private Balcony with Gulf views<br><br>**Please Note: ALL Top Bunks have a weight limit of 100lbs<br><br>PROPERTY HIGHLIGHTS:<br>• Charcoal BBQ Grill<br>• WiFi and Cable TV throughout<br>• Parking for up to two vehicles<br><br>ABOUT SEASIDE, FLORIDA:<br>• Walk to the Seaside Farmer's Market<br>• Retail therapy is at its best in SEASIDE<br>• Reserve Beach chairs and umbrellas through CABANA MAN during Peak Season (March - September)<br>• Enjoy theater, music, and film events throughout the year<br><br>Blue Swell Vacation Rentals is a boutique property management company that specializes in top-of-the-line, luxury beach rentals from PCB, 30A, and Destin. Our loyal guests come back year after year because of the exclusive homes and condos we offer as well as the excellent service we provide. Our keyless entry, premier linens with 300 thread count sheets, plush towels, and high-end starter supplies are just the beginning of the convenient amenities we provide for every guest. Most importantly, Blue Swell’s phone service allows our guests to experience the best vacation ever with less stress. It is always a SWELL day at the beach!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
