            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for taking the time to share your feedback! We’re glad to hear that you and your family enjoyed the house and that our management team made a positive impression.\n\nWe appreciate your comments regarding the loft. While it is listed as an additional sleeping space, we understand it may not be ideal for everyone due to the brightness and temperature, and we’ll be reviewing options to improve comfort for future guests. Your input is truly valuable.\n\nThank you again for staying with us—we hope to have the opportunity to host you all again in the future!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "The house was great. This was a fall break trip with my wife and 2 teenage kids and 3 of their friends. The management staff was great!. The only discrepancy is it really is only a 3 bedroom house. The loft isn't ideal to use as a bedroom as it is hot and gets very bright since there are no shades.",
